hadiths[87]{hadithnumber,text}:
"969","Abdullah bin Abi al Aswad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Marzooq Saqafi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, aur woh Abdullah bin Zubair ke paas the phir Hajjaj ne unhen un se le liya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Zubair ne mujhe apni walida Asma bint Abi Bakr ki taraf bheja tha to main unhen khabar deta tha ke Hajjaj un se kaisa sulook karta hai, aur woh mere liye dua kartin thin aur mere sar par haath phertin thin, aur main us din kam umar khadim tha."
"970","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Qasim bin Abdul Wahid se, unhon ne Ibn Aqeel se, ke Jabir bin Abdullah ne unhen bayan kiya, ke unhen Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahaba me se ek shakhs se ek hadith pahunchi, to maine ek oont khareeda phir maheene bhar tak us par apna kajawa kasa yahan tak ke main Shaam pahuncha, to wahan Abdullah bin Unais the, to maine un ki taraf paigham bheja ke Jabir darwaze par hai, to qasid wapas aaya to us ne kaha: Jabir bin Abdullah, to maine kaha: haan, to woh nikle aur mujh se lipat gaye, maine kaha: ek hadith mujhe pahunchi hai jo maine suni nahin, mujhe darr hua ke main mar jaun ya tum mar jao, unhon ne kaha: maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Allah bandon ko ya farmaya logon ko nange beghair khatna kiye hue besaman uthayega, maine kaha: behma kya hai, unhon ne kaha: un ke paas kuch nahin hoga, phir woh unhen aisi aawaz se pukarega jise door wala sunega, mera khayal hai unhon ne farmaya: jaise qareeb wala use sunega: main Badshah hun, jannat walon me se kisi shakhs ke liye jaiz nahin ke woh jannat me dakhil ho jabke dozakh walon me se koi shakhs us se kisi zulm ka badla mangta ho, aur dozakh walon me se kisi shakhs ke liye jaiz nahin ke woh dozakh me dakhil ho jabke jannat walon me se koi shakhs us se kisi zulm ka badla mangta ho, maine kaha: aur yeh kaise hoga jabke hum Allah ke paas nange besaman aayenge, unhon ne kaha: nekiyon aur buraiyon ke zariye."
"971","Muhammad bin Musanna ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Usman bin Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Israeel ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Maisara bin Habib se, unhon ne Minhal bin Amr se, unhon ne Aisha bint Talha se, unhon ne Ummul Momineen Aisha se, unhon ne kaha: maine Fatima se zyada Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se baat cheet aur guftagu me mushabeh koi shakhs nahin dekha, aur jab woh un ke paas aatin to woh un ki taraf uthte phir unhen khush aamdeed kehte aur unhen bosa dete aur unhen apni majlis me bithate, aur jab woh un ke paas jate to woh un ki taraf uthtin phir un ka haath pakad letin phir unhen khush aamdeed kehtin aur unhen bosa detin aur unhen apni majlis me bithatin, phir woh un ke paas un ke us marz me aayin jis me un ki wafat hui to unhon ne unhen khush aamdeed kaha aur unhen bosa diya."
"972","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Yazeed bin Abi Ziyad se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Abi Laila se, unhon ne Ibn Umar se, unhon ne kaha: hum ek ghazwa me the to log idhar udhar bhag nikle, hum ne kaha: hum Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se kaise milenge jabke hum bhag khade hue hain, phir yeh aayat nazil hui ke magar ladai ke liye chaal chalte hue, to hum ne kaha: hum Madina nahin jayenge taake hamen koi na dekhe, phir hum ne kaha: kash hum jayen, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam namaz e fajr se nikle, hum ne kaha: hum bhagne wale hain, unhon ne farmaya: tum palat kar hamla karne wale ho, to hum ne un ka haath bosa diya, unhon ne farmaya: main tumhara giroh hun."
"973","Ibn Abi Maryam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Attaf bin Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Abdur Rahman bin Razeen ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum Rabza se guzre to hum se kaha gaya: yahan Salama bin Akwa hain, to hum un ke paas aaye aur unhen salam kiya, to unhon ne apne dono haath nikale aur farmaya: maine in dono se Nabiyullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki baiyat ki thi, phir unhon ne apni ek hatheli nikali jo moti thi goya woh oont ke khur jaisi thi, to hum us ki taraf uthe aur hum ne use bosa diya."
"974","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyayna ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Judan se, ke Sabit ne Anas se kaha: kya tum ne apne haath se Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko chhua hai, unhon ne kaha: haan, to unhon ne use bosa diya."
"975","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Matar bin Abdur Rahman Anaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Sabah Abdul Qais ki ek khatoon ne bayan kiya jinhen Umm Aban bint Wazi kehte hain, unhon ne apne dada se, ke un ke dada Zari bin Amir ne kaha: hum aaye to kaha gaya: woh Rasoolullah hain, to hum ne un ke dono haathon aur dono paon ko pakad liya hum unhen bosa de rahe the."
"976","Abdur Rahman bin Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Habib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Zakwan se, unhon ne Suhaib se, unhon ne kaha: maine Ali ko dekha ke woh Abbas ke haath aur paon ko bosa de rahe the."
"977","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, aur Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Habib bin Shaheed ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine Abu Mijlaz ko kehte hue suna: Muawiya nikle aur Abdullah bin Amir aur Abdullah bin Zubair baithe hue the, to Ibn Amir khade ho gaye aur Ibn Zubair baithe rahe, aur woh dono me zyada sanjeeda the, Muawiya ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jise yeh khush kare ke Allah ke bande us ke liye khade rahen to use chahiye ke dozakh me apna ghar bana le."
"978","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne Hammam se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Allah ne Adam sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko apni surat par paida kiya, aur un ka qad saath haath tha, phir farmaya: jao aur farishton ke baithe hue us giroh ko salam karo aur suno ke woh tumhen kya tehniyat dete hain kyunke wohi tumhara salam hai aur tumhari aulad ka salam hai, to unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum, to unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaika wa rehmatullah, to unhon ne izafa kiya: wa rehmatullah, to har shakhs jo jannat me dakhil hoga us ki surat par hoga, phir makhlooq aaj tak ghatti chali gayi."
"979","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Qinan bin Abdullah Nahmi se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Ausaja se, unhon ne Bara se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: salam ko phailao salamti paoge."
"980","Muhammad bin Ubaidullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Hazim aur Qanabi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdul Aziz se, unhon ne Ala se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: tum jannat me dakhil nahin hoge yahan tak ke iman lao, aur iman nahin laoge yahan tak ke ek dusre se mohabbat karo, kya main tumhen us cheez ki rehnumai na karun jis se tum ek dusre se mohabbat karoge, unhon ne kaha: kyun nahin Ae Allah ke Rasool, unhon ne farmaya: apne darmiyan salam ko phailao."
"981","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Fuzail bin Ghazwan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ata bin Saib se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Rehman ki ibadat karo, khana khilao, aur salam ko aam karo, tum jannaton me dakhil ho jaoge."
"982","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Saeed bin Ubaid se, unhon ne Bushair bin Yasar se, unhon ne kaha: Koi shakhs Ibn Umar ko salam me pehal karne wala ya un se sabqat le jane wala na hota tha."
"983","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Makhlad bin Yazid ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Zubair ne mujhe khabar di, ke unhon ne Jabir ko ye kehte hue suna: Sawar paidal chalne wale ko salam kare, aur paidal chalne wala baithe hue ko salam kare, aur do paidal chalne walon me se jo dono me se salam me pehal kare woh afzal hai."
"984","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere bhai ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Sulaiman se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah bin Abi Ateeq se, unhon ne Nafi se, ke Ibn Umar ne unhen khabar di, ke Agharr, aur woh Muzaina ka ek shakhs tha, aur use Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sath sohbat hasil thi, us ke khajoor ke kai wasaq Banu Amr bin Auf ke ek shakhs ke zimme the, woh us ke pas bar bar aata jata raha, unhon ne kaha: Phir main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas aaya to unhon ne Abu Bakr Siddiq ko mere sath bhej diya, unhon ne kaha: Phir hum jin logon se bhi mile unhon ne hum par salam kiya, to Abu Bakr ne kaha: Kya tum nahi dekhte ke log tumhen salam me pehal karke ajr hasil kar rahe hain, tum unhen salam me pehal kiya karo taake ajr tumhara ho, ye Ibn Umar apne bare me bayan karte hain."
"985","Abdullah bin Yusuf aur Qanabi ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Malik ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Ata bin Yazid se, unhon ne Abu Ayyub se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Kisi Musalman shakhs ke liye halal nahi ke woh apne bhai se teen din se zyada qata talluq kare, phir woh dono milen to ye bhi munh pher le aur ye bhi munh pher le, aur un dono me behtar woh hai jo salam me pehal kare."
"986","Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Jafar bin Abi Kaseer ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Yaqoob bin Zaid Taimi se, unhon ne Saeed Maqburi se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se, ke ek shakhs Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas se guzra jabke Aap majlis me the to us ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum, to Aap ne farmaya: Das nekiyan, phir ek aur shakhs guzra to us ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullah, to Aap ne farmaya: Bees nekiyan, phir ek aur shakhs guzra to us ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuhu, to Aap ne farmaya: Tees nekiyan, phir ek shakhs majlis se utha aur us ne salam na kiya, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tumhare sathi ne kitni jaldi bhula diya, jab tum me se koi majlis me aaye to use salam karna chahiye, phir agar us ka ji chahe ke baithe to baithe, aur jab khara ho to salam kare, pehla salam akhri salam se zyada haqdar nahi."
"987","Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Jafar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdul Malik bin Maisara se, unhon ne Zaid bin Wahb se, unhon ne Umar se, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Bakr ke peeche sawar tha, woh logon ke pas se guzarte to kehte: Assalamu alaikum, to woh kehte: Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullah, aur woh kehte: Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullah, to woh kehte: Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuhu, to Abu Bakr ne kaha: Log aaj hum par bahut zyada fazilat le gaye."
"988","Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdus Samad ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Suhail bin Abi Saleh se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Aisha se, unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Yahudiyon ne tum se kisi cheez par itna hasad nahi kiya jitna unhon ne tum se salam aur aameen par hasad kiya."
"989","Shihab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Humaid se, unhon ne Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak salam Allah Taala ke naamon me se ek naam hai, Allah ne use zameen me rakha hai, pas apne darmiyan salam ko aam karo."
"990","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mahill ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Shaqeeq bin Salama Abu Wail ko zikr karte hue suna, unhon ne Ibn Masud se, unhon ne kaha: Woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke peeche namaz parhte the, kehne wale ne kaha: Assalamu alallah, phir jab Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne apni namaz poori ki to farmaya: Assalamu alallah kehne wala kaun hai, beshak Allah hi Assalam hai, lekin tum kaho: Attahiyyatu lillahi wassalawatu wattayyibat, assalamu alaika ayyuhan nabiyyu wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuhu, assalamu alaina wa ala ibadillahis saliheen, ashhadu alla ilaha illallah, wa ashhadu anna Muhammadan abduhu wa rasuluh, unhon ne kaha: Aur woh use is tarah seekhte the jaise tum me se koi Quran ki surat seekhta hai."
"991","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ala bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Musalman ka Musalman par haq cheh hain, kaha gaya: Aur woh kya hain, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum use milo to use salam karo, aur jab woh tumhen bulaye to us ki baat qabool karo, aur jab woh tum se naseehat mange to use naseehat karo, aur jab use cheenk aaye aur woh Alhamdulillah kahe to use Yarhamukallah kaho, aur jab woh beemar ho to us ki iyadat karo, aur jab woh faut ho jaye to us ke sath jao."
"992","Saeed bin Rabi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Yahya se, unhon ne kaha: Zaid bin Sallam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne dada Abu Sallam se, unhon ne Abu Rashid Hubrani se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Shibl se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Sawar ko chahiye ke paidal chalne wale ko salam kare, aur paidal chalne wala baithe hue ko salam kare, aur kam tadaad wale zyada tadaad walon ko salam karen, pas jo salam ka jawab de to woh us ke liye hai, aur jo jawab na de to us ke liye kuch nahi."
"993","Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Rauh bin Ubada ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ibn Juraij ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ziyad ne khabar di ke Sabit ne use khabar di, aur woh Abdur Rahman ke maula hain, woh use Abu Huraira se riwayat karte hain, woh Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: sawar paidal chalne wale ko salam kare, aur paidal chalne wala baithe hue ko, aur thore zyada ko."
"994","Ibn Juraij ne kaha: phir mujhe Abu Zubair ne khabar di ke unhon ne Jabir ko kehte hue suna: do paidal chalne wale jab ikatthe hon to un mein se jo pehle salam kare woh afzal hai."
"995","Nuaim bin Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Ibn Mubarak ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: humein Mamar ne khabar di, Hammam se, woh Abu Huraira se, woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: sawar paidal chalne wale ko salam kare, aur paidal chalne wala baithe hue ko, aur thore zyada ko."
"996","Asbagh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ibn Wahb ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ibn Hani ne khabar di, Amr bin Malik se, woh Fazala se, woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: ghor sawar baithe hue ko salam kare, aur thore zyada ko."
"997","Muhammad bin Kasir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Sulaiman bin Kasir ne khabar di, Husain se, Shaabi se ke woh ek sawar se mile to unhon ne use pehle salam kiya, to maine kaha: aap use pehle salam karte hain, unhon ne kaha: maine Shuraih ko paidal chalte hue pehle salam karte dekha."
"998","Abdullah bin Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Haywa ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Humaid Abu Hani ne khabar di ke Abu Ali Janbi ne use bayan kiya, Fazala bin Ubaid se, woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: sawar paidal chalne wale ko salam kare, aur paidal chalne wala baithe hue ko, aur thore zyada ko."
"999","Abdullah ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: humein Haywa bin Shuraih ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abu Hani Khaulani ne khabar di, Abu Ali Janbi se, woh Fazala se ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: ghor sawar paidal chalne wale ko salam kare, aur paidal chalne wala khare hue ko, aur thore zyada ko."
"1000","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Makhlad ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: humein Ibn Juraij ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ziyad ne khabar di ke unhon ne Sabit maula Ibn Zaid se suna ke unhon ne Abu Huraira ko kehte hue suna: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: sawar paidal chalne wale ko salam kare, aur paidal chalne wala baithe hue ko, aur thore zyada ko."
"1001","Ahmad bin Abi Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se mere walid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, Musa bin Uqba se, woh Safwan bin Sulaim se, woh Ata bin Yasar se, woh Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: chhota bare ko salam kare, aur chalne wala baithe hue ko, aur thore zyada ko."
"1001b","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: humein Makhlad ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: humein Ibn Juraij ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Ziyad ne khabar di, Abu Zinad se, unhon ne kaha: Kharija Zaid ki kitab par jab salam likhte to kehte: tum par salam ho aye Amir ul Momineen aur Allah ki rehmat aur Us ki barkatein aur Us ki maghfirat aur Us ki pakeezah duaein."
"1002","Bishr bin Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Hayyaj bin Bassam Abu Qurra Khurasani ne bayan kiya, maine use Basra me dekha, unhon ne kaha: maine Anas ko dekha woh humare paas se guzarte to apne haath se humari taraf ishara karte phir salam karte, aur un me safedi thi, aur maine Hasan ko dekha woh zardi se khizab lagate the, aur un par kali amama thi, aur Asma ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne aurton ki taraf haath se salam ke liye ishara kiya."
"1003","Ibrahim bin Munzir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Muhammad bin Maan ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Musa bin Sad ne bayan kiya, apne walid Sad se ke woh Abdullah bin Umar ke sath aur Qasim bin Muhammad ke sath nikle, yahan tak ke jab woh Sarif me utre to Abdullah bin Zubair guzre to unhon ne unhein salam ka ishara kiya, to dono ne unhe jawab diya."
"1004","Khallad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Misar ne hum se bayan kiya, Alqama bin Marsad se, Ata bin Abi Rabah se, unhon ne kaha: Wo haath se salaam ko makrooh samajhte the, ya unhon ne kaha: Wo haath se salaam ko makrooh samajhta tha."
"1005","Khallad bin Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Misar ne hum se bayan kiya, Sabit bin Ubaid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ek majlis me aaya jis me Abdullah bin Umar the, to unhon ne farmaya: Jab tum salaam karo to suna kar kaho, kyunke ye Allah ki taraf se mubarak paakiza salaam hai."
"1006","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talha se, ke Tufail bin Ubayy bin Kab ne unhen khabar di, ke wo Abdullah bin Umar ke paas aate the phir un ke sath subah bazaar jate the, unhon ne kaha: Phir jab hum subah bazaar jate to Abdullah bin Umar kisi raddi saman bechne wale par na kisi sauda bechne wale par na kisi miskin par na kisi shakhs par guzarte magar use salaam karte."
"1007","Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ajlan se, Saeed Maqburi se, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi majlis me aaye to use chahiye ke salaam kare, phir agar wapas aaye to use chahiye ke salaam kare, kyunke dusri pehli se zyada haqdar nahi hai."
"1008","Khalid bin Makhlad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Bilal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ajlan ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab aadmi majlis me aaye to use chahiye ke salaam kare, phir agar baithe phir use khayal aaye ke majlis ke muntashir hone se pehle khara ho jaye to use chahiye ke salaam kare, kyunke pehli dusri se zyada haqdar nahi hai."
"1009","Matar bin Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rauh bin Ubada ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bistam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muawiya bin Qurra ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se kaha: Aye mere bete, agar tum aisi majlis me ho jis ki bhalai ki ummeed rakhte ho phir tumhen koi hajat jaldi le jaye to kaho: Salaamun alaikum, kyunke tum unhen us sawab me shareek karte ho jo unhen us majlis me mila, aur koi qaum kisi majlis me nahi baithti phir us se aise muntashir hoti hai ke us me Allah ka zikr na kiya gaya ho magar goya wo gadhe ki murdar par se muntashir hue."
"1010","Abdullah bin Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muawiya ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Maryam se, Abu Huraira se, ke unhon ne unhen ye kehte hue suna: Jo apne bhai se mile to use chahiye ke use salaam kare, phir agar un dono ke darmiyan darakht ya deewar hail ho jaye phir us se mile to use chahiye ke use salaam kare."
"1011","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zahhak bin Nibras Abul Hasan ne hum se bayan kiya, Sabit Bunani se, Anas bin Malik se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke ashaab ikatthe hote the phir un ke samne darakht aa jata to un me se ek giroh us ke dayen taraf se nikal jata aur ek giroh us ke bayen taraf se, phir jab wo milte to ek dusre ko salaam karte."
"1012","Ubaidullah bin Saeed ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid bin Khidash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Wahb Misri ne hum se bayan kiya, Quraish Basri se jo Ibn Hayyan hai, Sabit Bunani se, ke Anas jab subah karte to apna haath khushbudar tel se chikna karte taake apne bhaiyon se musafaha karen."
"1013","Qutaiba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Lais ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Abi Habib se, Abul Khair se, Abdullah bin Amr se, ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, kaun sa Islam behtar hai, unhon ne farmaya: Tum khana khilao aur salaam karo use jise tum jante ho aur use jise tum nahi jante."
"1014","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Zurai ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed bin Abi Saeed se, Abu Huraira se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne khule sahnon aur unche rastaon me baithne se mana farmaya, to Musalmanon ne kaha: Hum is ki taqat nahi rakhte, hum se ye nahi ho sakta, unhon ne farmaya: Agar nahi to is ka haq ada karo, unhon ne kaha: Aur is ka haq kya hai, unhon ne farmaya: Nigah neechi karna aur musafir ko rasta batana aur chheenkne wale ka jawab dena jab wo Alhamdulillah kahe aur salaam ka jawab dena."
"1015","Ahmad bin Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kinana maula Safiyya ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Logon me sab se zyada bakhil wo hai jo salaam me bakhil kare, aur ghaata uthane wala wo hai jo us ka jawab na de, aur agar tere aur tere bhai ke darmiyan darakht hail ho to agar tu istitaat rakhe ke use salaam me pehal kare ke wo tujh se pehal na kare to aisa kar."
"1016","Imran bin Maisara ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Waris ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Husain se, unhon ne Amr bin Shuaib se, unhon ne Salim jo Abdullah bin Amr ke maula hain se rivayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: aur Ibn Amr ka mamul tha ke jab unhen salam kiya jata to jawab me izafa farmate, pas me un ke pas aya jabke wo baithe hue the to mene kaha: Assalamu alaikum, to unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullah, phir me dusri martaba un ke pas aya to mene kaha: Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullah, to unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullah wa barakatuhu, phir me teesri martaba un ke pas aya to mene kaha: Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullah wa barakatuhu, to unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullah wa barakatuhu wa tayyib salawatihi."
"1017","Saeed bin Abi Maryam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bakr bin Mudar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah bin Zahr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Hibban bin Abi Jabala se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas se rivayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sharab peene walon ko salam na karo."
"1018","Muhammad bin Mahbub aur Mualla aur Arim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Qatada se, unhon ne Hasan se rivayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Tumhare aur fasiq ke darmiyan koi hurmat nahi hai."
"1019","Ibrahim bin Munzir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maan bin Isa ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ruzaik ne mujh se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Ali bin Abdullah ko suna, wo asbiranj ko na pasand karte the aur kehte the: Jo is se khele use salam na karo, aur ye maisir me se hai."
"1020","Zakariya bin Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qasim bin Hakam Urani ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin Ubaid Tai ne humen khabar di, unhon ne Ali bin Rabia se, unhon ne Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib raziyallahu anhu se rivayat kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek qaum ke pas se guzre jin me ek aadmi tha jo khaluq me ranga hua tha, pas Aap ne un ki taraf dekha aur unhen salam kiya aur us aadmi se airaz farmaya, to us aadmi ne kaha: Kya Aap ne mujh se airaz farmaya hai, Aap ne farmaya: Us ki dono aankhon ke darmiyan angara hai."
"1021","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Ajlan se, unhon ne Amr bin Shuaib bin Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas bin Wail Sahmi se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se rivayat kiya ke ek aadmi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas aya jabke us ke hath me sone ki anguthi thi, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne us se airaz farmaya, pas jab us aadmi ne Aap ki na pasandidgi dekhi to gaya aur anguthi phenk di aur lohe ki anguthi li aur use pehen liya aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas aya, Aap ne farmaya: Ye bura hai, ye dozakh walon ka zewar hai, pas wo wapas gaya aur use phenk diya aur chandi ki anguthi pehni, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam is par khamosh rahe."
"1022","Abdullah bin Saleh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Lais ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Amr se jo Ibn Haris hain se, unhon ne Bakr bin Sawada se, unhon ne Abu Najeeb se, unhon ne Abu Saeed se rivayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bahrain se ek aadmi Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf aya aur Aap ko salam kiya to Aap ne jawab na diya jabke us ke hath me sone ki anguthi thi aur us par resham ka jubba tha, pas wo aadmi ghamgeen ho kar chala gaya aur apni biwi se shikayat ki to us ne kaha: Shayad Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko tumhare jubbe aur tumhari anguthi se nagawari hui hai, pas in dono ko utar phenko phir wapas jao, to us ne aisa hi kiya to Aap ne salam ka jawab diya, to us ne kaha: Me abhi Aap ke pas aya tha to Aap ne mujh se airaz farmaya, Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare hath me aag ka angara tha, to us ne kaha: Tab to me bahut se angare lekar aya tha, Aap ne farmaya: Jo kuch tum lekar aye ho wo Harra ke patharon se zyada hamare liye kifayat karne wala nahi hai lekin ye duniya ki zindagi ka saman hai, us ne kaha: To phir me kis cheez ki anguthi pehnun, Aap ne farmaya: Chandi ya peetal ya lohe ke chhalle se."
"1023","Abdul Ghaffar bin Daud ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yaqub bin Abdur Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Musa bin Uqba se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se rivayat kiya ke Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne Abu Bakr bin Sulaiman bin Abi Hathma se pucha: Abu Bakr kyun likha karte the: Abu Bakr khalifa Rasoolullah ki taraf se, phir un ke baad Umar likha karte the: Umar bin Khattab khalifa Abu Bakr ki taraf se, sab se pehle kis ne Amirul Mominin likha, to unhon ne kaha: Mujh se meri dadi Shifa ne bayan kiya jo pehli hijrat karne wali aurton me se thin aur Hazrat Umar bin Khattab raziyallahu anhu jab bazar me dakhil hote to un ke pas jate, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab ne Iraqain ke aamil ko likha ke mere pas do mazbut aur shareef aadmi bhejo jin se me Iraq aur us ke logon ke bare me puchhun, to Iraqain ke sahib ne un ke pas Labid bin Rabia aur Adi bin Hatim ko bhej diya, pas wo dono Madina aye aur unhon ne apni dono sawariyan masjid ke sehan me bithain, phir dono masjid me dakhil hue to unhon ne Amr bin Aas ko paya, to dono ne un se kaha: Ai Amr, hamare liye Amirul Mominin Umar se ijazat lo, to Amr uthe aur Umar ke pas dakhil hue aur kaha: Assalamu alaika ya Amirul Mominin, to Umar ne un se kaha: Ai Ibn Aas, tumhen ye naam kahan se sujha hai, tum ne jo kaha hai us ki wazahat karo, unhon ne kaha: Ji han, Labid bin Rabia aur Adi bin Hatim aye hain, to dono ne mujh se kaha: Hamare liye Amirul Mominin se ijazat lo, to mene kaha: Allah ki qasam tum dono ne un ka durust naam paya hai aur beshak wo amir hain aur hum momin hain, pas usi din se khat me ye silsila jaari ho gaya."
"1024","Abul Yaman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuaib ne humen khabar di, unhon ne Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ubaidullah bin Abdullah ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Muawiya apne pehle hajj ke liye hajj karne aya jabke wo khalifa tha, to Usman bin Hunaif Ansari us ke pas dakhil hue aur kaha: Assalamu alaika ayyuhal amir wa rahmatullah, to Sham walon ne is ko bura jana aur kaha: Ye munafiq kaun hai jo Amirul Mominin ki tehniyat me kami karta hai, to Usman apne ghutnon par jhuk gaye phir kaha: Ai Amirul Mominin, beshak in logon ne mujh par ek aisi baat par aitiraz kiya hai jise aap in se zyada jante hain, pas Allah ki qasam mene isi ke sath Abu Bakr aur Umar aur Usman ko salam kiya tha to un me se kisi ne is par aitiraz na kiya, to Muawiya ne Sham walon me se jo bola tha us se kaha: Thahro, beshak us ki baat me kuch sadaqat thi lekin Sham walon me ye fitne paida ho gaye hain, unhon ne kaha: Hamare han hamare khalifa ki tehniyat me kami na ki jaye, pas me gumaan karta hun ke ai Madina walo tum sadaqa ke aamil ko kehte ho: Ayyuhal amir."
"1025","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Muhammad bin Munkadir se, unhon ne Jabir se rivayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Me Hajjaj ke pas dakhil hua to mene use salam na kiya."
"1026","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Mughira se, unhon ne Simak bin Salama Dabbi se, unhon ne Tamim bin Hazlam se rivayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Kufa me sab se pehla aadmi yaad hai jis ko imarat ke lafz se salam kiya gaya, Mughira bin Shuba Babur Rahaba se nikle to Kinda ka ek aadmi achanak un ke samne aya, logon ka gumaan hai ke wo Abu Qurra Kindi tha, to us ne unhen salam kiya aur kaha: Assalamu alaika ayyuhal amir wa rahmatullah, Assalamu alaikum, to unhon ne ise na pasand kiya, to unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum ayyuhal amir wa rahmatullah, Assalamu alaikum, kya me unhi me se hun ya nahi, Simak ne kaha: Phir unhon ne baad me is ka iqrar kar liya."
"1027","Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Haywa bin Shuraih ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Ziyad bin Ubaid ne bayan kiya jo Himyar ke ek batn me se hain, unhon ne kaha: Hum Ruwaifi ke pas gaye jabke wo Antablus ke amir the, pas ek aadmi aya aur unhen salam kiya jabke hum un ke pas the, to us ne kaha: Assalamu alaika ayyuhal amir, to Ruwaifi ne us se kaha: Agar tum humen salam karte to hum tumhare salam ka jawab dete lekin tum ne to Maslama bin Makhlad ko salam kiya hai jabke Maslama Misr par the, jao un ke pas jao wo tumhare salam ka jawab den."
"1028","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin al-Mughira ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sabit ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin Abi Laila se, Miqdad bin al-Aswad se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam raat ko tashreef late to aisa salam karte jo sone wale ko na jagata aur jaagne wale ko suna deta."
"1029","Amr bin Abbas ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Shabi se ke Hazrat Umar ne Adi bin Hatim se kaha: Allah tumhen maarifat ke sabab se zindagi de."
"1030","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zakariya ne hum se bayan kiya, Firas se, Amir se, Masruq se, Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne farmaya: Fatima chalti hui aayin goya un ki chaal Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki chaal thi, to Aap ne farmaya: Meri beti ko khush aamdeed, phir unhen apne dayen ya bayen bithaya."
"1031","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Hani bin Hani se, Hazrat Ali raziyallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Ammar ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se andar aane ki ijazat maangi, to Aap ne un ki awaz pehchani, phir farmaya: Pakiza aur pakeeza banaye gaye ko khush aamdeed."
"1032","Yahya bin Sulaiman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Haywa ne mujhe khabar di, Uqba bin Muslim se, Abdullah bin Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Jab ke hum Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas Makkah aur Madina ke darmiyan ek darakht ke saye mein baithe hue the ke logon mein se sab se zyada sakht tabiat aur sab se sakht ek dehati aaya to us ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum, to unhon ne kaha: Wa alaikum."
"1033","Hamid bin Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Jamra se ke main ne Ibn Abbas ko suna, jab unhen salam kiya jata to kehte: Tum par bhi salam ho aur Allah ki rehmat ho."
"1034","Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Qaila ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne kaha: Assalamu alaika ae Allah ke Rasool, to unhon ne kaha: Tum par bhi salam ho aur Allah ki rehmat ho."
"1035","Abdullah bin Maslama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin al-Mughira ne hum se bayan kiya, Humaid bin Hilal se, Abdullah bin Samit se, Abu Dharr se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas hazir hua jab Aap apni namaz se farigh ho chuke the, to main sab se pehla shakhs tha jis ne Aap ko Islam ke salam ke sath salam kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Tum par bhi salam ho aur Allah ki rehmat ho, tum kin logon mein se ho, main ne kaha: Ghifar me se."
"1036","Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Lais ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Salama ne kaha ke Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha ne farmaya: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ae Aish, ye Jibril hain, aur wo tum par salam bhejte hain, unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Un par bhi salam aur Allah ki rehmat aur us ki barkaten hon, Aap wo dekhte hain jo main nahin dekhti, is se un ki murad Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam the."
"1037","Matar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rauh bin Ubada ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bistam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muawiya bin Qurra ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se kaha: Ae mere bete, jab koi shakhs tumhare paas se guzre aur kahe: Assalamu alaikum, to tum mat kaho: Wa alaika, goya tum us ko is ke sath tanha makhsoos kar rahe ho, kyun ke wo akela nahin hai, lekin kaho: Assalamu alaikum."
"1038","Ayyash bin al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, Humaid bin Hilal se, Abdullah bin Samit se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Dharr se kaha: Main Abdur Rahman bin Umm al-Hakam ke paas se guzra to main ne salam kiya, to us ne mujhe kuch jawab nahin diya, to unhon ne kaha: Ae mere bhatije, is se tumhara kya nuqsan hai, tum ko us se behtar ne jawab diya hai, ek farishta jo us ke dayen taraf hai."
"1039","Umar bin Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zaid bin Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Beshak salam Allah ke naamon mein se ek naam hai, Allah ne use zameen mein rakha hai, pas use apne darmiyan phailao, beshak jab aadmi kisi qaum ko salam karta hai aur wo use jawab dete hain to use un par ek darje ki fazilat hasil hoti hai, kyun ke us ne unhen salam yaad dilaya, aur agar use jawab na diya jaye to use wo jawab deta hai jo us se behtar aur pakeezatar hai."
"1040","Muhammad bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham se, Hasan se, unhon ne farmaya: Salam kehna nafl hai aur salam ka jawab dena farz hai."
"1041","Muhammad bin Abi Bakr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fudail bin Sulaiman ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa bin Uqba se, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah bin Salman ne mujh se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas se, unhon ne farmaya: Jhoota woh hai jo apni qasam par jhoot bole aur bakheel woh hai jo salam mein bukhl kare aur chor woh hai jo namaz mein chori kare."
"1042","Ismail bin Aban ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Mushir ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Usman se, Abu Huraira se, unhon ne farmaya: Sab se zyada bakheel woh hai jo salam mein bukhl karta hai aur beshak sab se zyada aajiz woh hai jo dua mangne se aajiz ho."
"1043","Ali bin al-Jad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Sayyar se, Sabit al-Bunani se, Anas bin Malik se ke woh bachon ke paas se guzre to unhon ne un ko salam kiya aur farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ke sath aisa hi kiya karte the."
"1044","Muhammad bin Ubaid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa bin Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Anbasa se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ibn Umar ko dekha ke woh maktab mein bachon ko salam karte the."
"1045","Abdullah bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne hum ko khabar di, Abu al-Nadr se ke Abu Murra jo Umm Hani bint Abi Talib ke maula hain unhon ne un ko khabar di ke unhon ne Umm Hani ko kehte hue suna: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas gayi jabke woh ghusl kar rahe the to maine un par salam kiya to unhon ne farmaya: Ye kaun hain, maine kaha: Umm Hani, unhon ne farmaya: Khush aamdeed."
"1046","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hasan ko kehte hue suna: Auratein mardon ko salam kiya karti thin."
"1047","Muhammad bin Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Hamid bin Bahram ne hum se bayan kiya, Shahr se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Asma se suna ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam masjid mein se guzre jabke aurton ki ek jamaat baithi hui thi to unhon ne apne hath se un ki taraf salam ka ishara kiya phir farmaya: Ehsaan karne walon ki nashukri se bacho, ehsaan karne walon ki nashukri se bacho, un mein se ek ne kaha: Allah ki panah, Ya Nabiyallah, Allah ki nematon ki nashukri se, farmaya: Haan beshak tum mein se ek ka baghair shohar ke rehna lamba ho jata hai phir woh gussa hoti hai to kehti hai: Allah ki qasam maine us se kabhi ek ghari bhi bhalae nahi dekhi to yehi Allah ki nematon ki nashukri hai aur yehi ehsaan karne walon ki nashukri hai."
"1048","Makhlad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mubashshir bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Ghaniya se, Muhammad bin Muhajir se, apne walid se, Asma bint Yazid al-Ansariya se ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam mere paas se guzre jabke main apni hum umr saheliyon ke darmiyan thi to unhon ne hum par salam kiya aur farmaya: Ehsaan karne walon ki nashukri se bacho, aur main un mein un se sawal karne mein sab se zyada diler thi to maine kaha: Ya Rasoolallah, ehsaan karne walon ki nashukri kya hai, farmaya: Shayad tum mein se ek apne walidain ke paas baghair shohar ke lambi muddat rehti hai phir Allah use shohar ata karta hai aur use us se aulad ata karta hai phir woh gusse hoti hai to nashukri karti hai aur kehti hai: Maine tum se kabhi koi bhalae nahi dekhi."
"1049","Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, Bashir bin Salman se, Sayyar Abul Hakam se, Tariq se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Abdullah ke paas baithe hue the to un ka ijazat talab karne wala aaya aur kaha: Namaz khadi ho gayi hai to woh khade hue aur hum bhi un ke sath khade ho gaye phir hum masjid mein dakhil hue to unhon ne logon ko masjid ke agle hisse mein ruku mein dekha to unhon ne takbeer kahi aur ruku kiya aur hum chalte rahe aur hum ne bhi waisa hi kiya jaisa unhon ne kiya phir ek tez chalne wala shakhs guzra aur kaha: Alaikumus salam Ya Aba Abdur Rahman to unhon ne kaha: Allah ne sach farmaya aur us ke Rasool ne pahuncha diya phir jab hum ne namaz padh li to woh wapas hue aur apne ghar walon ke paas dakhil hue aur hum apni jagah baithe un ka intezar karte rahe hatta ke woh bahar niklein to hum mein se baaz ne baaz se kaha: Tum mein se kaun un se puchega, Tariq ne kaha: Main un se puchunga to unhon ne un se pucha to unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat hai ke unhon ne farmaya: Qayamat se pehle khas logon ko salam karna hoga aur tijarat phail jayegi hatta ke aurat tijarat mein apne shohar ki madad karegi aur rishtedariyan kati jayengi aur qalam phail jayega aur jhooti gawahi zahir hogi aur sacchi gawahi chhupayi jayegi."
"1050","Abdullah bin Saleh ne kaha: Lais ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Abi Habib ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abul Khair se, Abdullah bin Amr se ke ek shakhs ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se pucha: Islam mein kaunsi cheez behtar hai, farmaya: Khana khilana aur salam padhna us par jise tu janta ho aur jise tu na janta ho."
"1051","Abdullah bin Saleh ne kaha: Lais ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uqail ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Anas ne mujhe khabar di ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki Madina tashreef aawari ke waqt woh das saal ke the aur meri walidahen mujhe un ki khidmat par lagati thin to maine das saal un ki khidmat ki aur jab un ki wafat hui to main bees saal ka tha to main logon mein hijab ke mamle ko sab se zyada janne wala tha phir sab se pehle jo nazil hua woh ye tha jab Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Zainab bint Jahsh se nikah kiya subah ko woh dulhan bani hui un ke paas thin to unhon ne qaum ko bulaya to unhon ne khana khaya phir woh bahar nikal gaye aur kuch log Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas reh gaye to unhon ne thaharna lamba kar diya to Aap khade hue aur bahar nikle aur main bhi nikla taake woh nikal jayein phir Aap chale to main bhi Aap ke sath chala hatta ke Aap Ayesha ke hujre ki dehleez tak aaye phir Aap ne gumaan kiya ke woh nikal gaye hain to Aap wapas hue aur main bhi Aap ke sath wapas hua hatta ke Zainab ke paas dakhil hue to dekha ke woh baithe hue hain to Aap wapas hue aur main bhi wapas hua hatta ke Ayesha ke hujre ki dehleez tak pahunche aur gumaan kiya ke woh nikal gaye hain to Aap wapas hue aur main bhi Aap ke sath wapas hua to dekha ke woh nikal chuke the to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mere aur apne darmiyan parda latka diya aur hijab nazil hua."
"1052","Abdul Aziz bin Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sad ne hum se bayan kiya, Saleh bin Kaisan se, Ibn Shihab se, Salaba bin Abi Malik Qurazi se ke woh Abdullah bin Suwaid ke paas sawari karke gaya jo Bani Harisa bin al-Haris mein se hain taake un se teen parda wale auqat ke bare mein puche aur woh un par amal karta tha to unhon ne kaha: tum kya chahte ho, to maine kaha: main chahta hun ke un par amal karun, to unhon ne kaha: jab main dopahar ke waqt apne kapde utar deta hun to mere ghar walon mein se koi shakhs jo balughat ko pahunch chuka ho meri ijazat ke baghair mere paas dakhil nahi hota magar yeh ke main use bulaun to wahi us ki ijazat hai, aur na jab fajr tulu ho jaye aur log chalne phirne lagen hatta ke namaz parh li jaye, aur na jab main Isha ki namaz parh lun aur apne kapde utar dun hatta ke so jaun."
"1053","Humaidi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Misar se, Musa bin Abi Kasir se, Mujahid se, Hazrat Aisha raziyallahu anha se, unhon ne farmaya: main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sath hais kha rahi thi, pas Umar guzre to Aap ne unhen bulaya to unhon ne khaya to un ka hath meri ungli ko lag gaya to unhon ne kaha: hass, agar meri baat mani jaye to tumhen koi aankh na dekhe, pas hijab nazil hua."
"1054","Ismail bin Abi Uwais ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kharja bin al-Haris bin Rafi bin Mukis Juhani ne mujh se bayan kiya, Salim bin Sarj se jo Umm Sabiyya bint Qais ke maula hain aur woh Khaula hain aur woh Kharja bin al-Haris ki dadi hain, ke us ne unhen kehte hue suna: mera hath aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka hath ek hi bartan mein ikattha hua."
